[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランツェさんたちとは仲良くやってるみたいだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Looks like you're getting along well with Lanze and the others."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ、家族としてね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, we're like family."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "家族が２つあるとは、考えようによっては\n素敵な環境だな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Having two families—that's actually kind of wonderful when you think about it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ねぇ、私たちは創られた存在、なのよね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hey, we're created beings, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうさ。パルメ族によって創られたホムンクルス……\nそれがアタシら九偉人だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right. Homunculi created by the Palme... That's what we are, the Miraculous Nine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうしてパルメ族は私たちを創ったの？\n世界を「管理」するために駒が必要だったから？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why did the Palme create us? Because they needed pawns to \"manage\" the world?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "僕たちはあらゆる災厄から\nパルメ族を守るために創られたのさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We were created to protect the Palme from all kinds of calamities."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "パルメ族は世界を「管理」し、人間を導く存在。\nパルメ族のために動くのが、生まれた役目です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Palme \"manage\" the world and guide humanity. Serving them is the purpose we were born with."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その辺り、アタシは考え方を変えたけど\nまあ、今はそこは置いとこうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My thinking's changed on that front, but let's set that aside for now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、レスナが前に言ってたけど、パルメ族は災厄で\nほとんどが滅びちゃったって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But Resna said before that most of the Palme died in a disaster..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちは、パルメ族を守れなかったってこと？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Does that mean we failed to protect them?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "違うよ。僕らがいたからこそ、少しでも生き残れた。\nザスキアやアウグストのように",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No. It's because we existed that any survived at all. Like Saskia and August."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう……それならよかった――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see... That's good then—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いつっ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ow..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お、おい、大丈夫か？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "H-Hey, are you okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……大丈夫。無理に昔のことを思い出そうとすると\nいつも頭が痛くなっちゃうのよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'm fine. Whenever I try too hard to remember the past, my head starts hurting."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "結局、ぼんやりとした記憶以外は\n何も思い出せないし……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In the end, I can't recall anything besides hazy fragments..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "無理に思い出さなくてもいい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You don't have to force yourself to remember."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "とにかく、私は兄弟が傷つくのは見たくないのだ。\n皆で仲良くやれば、まずはそれでいい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What matters is that I don't want to see my siblings hurting. If we can all get along, that's enough for now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……心配させて、ごめん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... Sorry for worrying you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]